; Ready-to-drive rover — one GWRover node that self-assembles its SITL bridge,
; model, and (optional) camera. Instance into a scene with a camera, run SITL
; with VEHICLE=Rover, and connect. Tick `enable_camera` for video; swap
; `config` / `model_scene` for your own (see GWRover for the model standard).
[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

